OL,3,GNEWSAShop owners left fearful after
OL,4,Ajewellers raided
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's highly concerning. The question
OL,7,Fnow is who is going to be next?" says
OL,8,Fshop owner Faizan Hussain after a
OL,9,Fviolent robbery took place nearby.
OL,11,FThe retail community has been left in
OL,12,Fshock after six men raided Lala
OL,13,FJewellers on Gladstone Street,
OL,14,FPeterborough, shortly before 12:00 GMT
OL,15,Fon Saturday, Cambridgeshire Police
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FA 50-year-old employee suffered serious
OL,19,Finjuries and remained in a
OL,20,Flife-threatening condition in hospital.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
