OL,3,GNEWSAShop owners left fearful after
OL,4,Ajewellers raided
OL,5,
OL,6,FHussain, who runs Ghousia Food Store on
OL,7,FGladstone Street, says: "I was very
OL,8,Fsurprised. During the night, you might
OL,9,Fthink yes, a robbery, but during the
OL,10,Fday - it never crossed our mind."
